# skill-link: each skill in .agents/skills has a .claude/skills link to it, the hit on its SKILL.md
spec: Finders
args: agent-files skill-link
-- .agents/skills/linked/SKILL.md --
x
-- .claude/skills/linked -> ../../.agents/skills/linked --
-- .agents/skills/unlinked/SKILL.md --
x
-- .agents/skills/elsewhere/SKILL.md --
x
-- .claude/skills/elsewhere -> ../../.agents/skills/linked --
-- @stdout --
.agents/skills/elsewhere/SKILL.md: .claude/skills/elsewhere links to ../../.agents/skills/linked, not ../../.agents/skills/elsewhere
.agents/skills/unlinked/SKILL.md: no .claude/skills/unlinked link
